    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Advanced Nursing School in Kampala, Uganda graduated 49 students. Twenty-nine students received a Bachelor of Science in Nursing and 20 students were awarded a Diploma in General Nursing. An award of academic excellence was presented to Junit Annete Wakore, who graduated with a Bachelor of Science degree in Nursing and Susan Alum who graduated with a Diploma in General Nursing. This award was presented to them for having demonstrated outstanding performance in their studies. Professor George Wilson Kanyeihamba, Former Supreme Court Judge and Legal Advisor on Human Rights and International Affairs to President Museveni of Uganda, was the chief guest.",
